            <column-instance column='[Vendors taken live yesterday (copy)_844284200646950915]' derivation='CountD' name='[ctd:Vendors taken live yesterday (copy)_844284200646950915:vtsum:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' visual-totals='Sum' />
            <column datatype='date' name='[date]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
